{"repo": {"timestamp": 1792200453000, "version": 20002, "name": "Sovereign Edge", "icon": "icon.png", "address": "https://frenchtoastbig7-ux.github.io/fdroid/repo", "description": "Apps by Sovereign Edge Inc. for GrapheneOS and Pixel. Pocket Agent, a private on-device Claude agent; Pocket Pantry, a pantry, grocery cart and Claude recipes app; Pocket Concierge, an offline HTML itinerary viewer with Claude; and Pocket Coach, an open-source strength training app with spreadsheet plan import."}, "requests": {"install": [], "uninstall": []}, "apps": [{"antiFeatures": ["NonFreeNet"], "authorName": "Sovereign Edge Inc.", "categories": ["AI Chat"], "suggestedVersionCode": "2", "description": "Pocket Agent is a personal assistant that runs on your phone and uses Claude as its model. It is built for GrapheneOS and talks to exactly one server: Anthropic's API.\n\nWhat it can do, with your permission:\n* Read and send SMS, look up contacts, read and add calendar events, read the call log and recent notifications\n* Read and write files in a private workspace folder\n* Search and read the web\n* Read the screen and tap, type and scroll in other apps (accessibility service)\n* Remember you across chats (MEMORY.md / USER.md), write reusable skills, and search past chats\n* Run scheduled automations that report back in a private notification\n* Split research into parallel read-only sub-agents\n\nAnything that sends, taps, types or changes data is shown to you for approval first. Scheduled runs are read-only. The API key is encrypted with the Android Keystore. There are no analytics and no Google Play Services.\n\nYou need your own Anthropic API key.", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-agent/issues", "license": "Apache-2.0", "name": "Pocket Agent", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-agent", "summary": "Private on-device Claude agent with memory, skills and automations", "added": 1789344199000, "packageName": "com.sovereignedge.pocketagent", "lastUpdated": 1789347770000}, {"authorName": "Sovereign Edge Inc.", "categories": ["Sports & Health"], "suggestedVersionCode": "4", "description": "Pocket Coach is an open-source strength and conditioning app in the spirit of TrainHeroic: a coach writes a program, the athlete follows it day by day, logs every set and watches their numbers move.\n\n* Today: a week strip with the session your program puts on each day, one tap from starting\n* Programs: weeks x days of sessions made of blocks (supersets) with per-set prescriptions as % of 1RM, RPE or a fixed load\n* Workout logging with targets already turned into kilos or pounds, a rest timer and automatic estimated one-rep maxes\n* Library of about 90 exercises plus your own, each with a 1RM, an e1RM chart and full history\n* Progress: totals, a 12-week volume chart, records and history\n* Import a training plan from a CSV or Excel spreadsheet, or a Pocket Coach program file; export programs to share with athletes\n\nEverything stays on the phone: no account, no server, no analytics, and the app has no network permission.", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-coach/issues", "license": "Apache-2.0", "name": "Pocket Coach", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-coach", "summary": "Strength training programs, set logging, 1RM tracking and spreadsheet plan import", "added": 1792193697000, "packageName": "com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach", "lastUpdated": 1792200453000}, {"antiFeatures": ["NonFreeNet"], "authorName": "Sovereign Edge Inc.", "categories": ["Navigation"], "suggestedVersionCode": "2", "description": "Pocket Concierge keeps your travel itineraries on the phone as single HTML files and shows them offline.\n\n* Library of itineraries imported with the file picker, \"Open with\", or Share from Chrome, Drive, Claude or a file manager\n* Each itinerary keeps its own checklist progress (localStorage, scoped per file) across restarts; pull down to reload\n* Directions links open natively in Google Maps; other links open in their own apps\n* Generate with Claude: describe a trip and get a finished itinerary, unlocked once you add your own Claude API key\n* Claude connector: an MCP server on the phone that lets Claude Code or the Claude app on your computer list, read, add and revise itineraries over your VPN (Tailscale) or USB, protected by a token\n* Follows system dark mode, edge-to-edge\n\nEverything is stored on the phone. The API key and connector token are encrypted with the Android Keystore.", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-concierge/issues", "license": "Apache-2.0", "name": "Pocket Concierge", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-concierge", "summary": "Offline viewer for self-contained HTML travel itineraries, with Claude", "added": 1791860944000, "packageName": "com.pocketconcierge", "lastUpdated": 1791860944000}, {"antiFeatures": ["NonFreeDep", "NonFreeNet"], "authorName": "Sovereign Edge Inc.", "categories": ["Sports & Health"], "suggestedVersionCode": "13", "description": "Pocket Pantry keeps track of the food in your household and what it costs to replace it. Built for the Pixel 10 Pro and Pro XL.\n\n* Pantry inventory organised by storage location (Pantry, Counter, Fridge, Freezer or your own) with quantities, expiry dates and low-stock warnings\n* Cart: pick your grocery store, scan items as they go in the cart and watch the running total with tax. Prices are remembered per store, and finishing a trip can add everything to the pantry\n* Shopping list that ticks itself off as you scan, and takes low-stock items or a recipe's missing ingredients in bulk\n* Recipes and meal plans from Claude, unlocked once you add your own Claude API key. Claude is told what you have and what is expiring; replies can be saved and their missing ingredients sent to the list\n* Light, dark or system theme with Material You colours\n\nEverything is stored on the phone. The API key is encrypted with the Android Keystore. Barcodes are read on-device with ML Kit's bundled model (no Play Services); unknown barcodes are looked up on Open Food Facts and cached.", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-pantry/issues", "license": "Apache-2.0", "name": "Pocket Pantry", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-pantry", "summary": "Pantry inventory, barcode grocery cart, shopping list and Claude recipes", "added": 1791856909000, "packageName": "com.sovereignedge.pocketpantry", "lastUpdated": 1792033067000}], "packages": {"com.pocketconcierge": [{"added": 1791860944000, "apkName": "com.pocketconcierge_2.apk", "hash": "a3da7d89f3bcb2f8f52c2e320fcd79d031793eb5aa32eb9275c027c0feb2162b", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 26, "nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "packageName": "com.pocketconcierge", "sig": "f74837f13724392913a54f3d37ccafb8", "signer": "594244931b2f8775016c3563f35c03859a2fad52f684197016cc2c23cbcbb850", "size": 8241647, "targetSdkVersion": 37, "uses-permission": [["android.permission.INTERNET", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE", null], ["android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE", null], ["com.pocketconcierge.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION", null]], "versionCode": 2, "versionName": "1.1.0"}], "com.sovereignedge.pocketagent": [{"added": 1789347770000, "apkName": "com.sovereignedge.pocketagent_2.apk", "hash": "56d48eca9d31d62dc61100fe936f4d211076d23058fb25293e49bc13e8045a01", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 33, "nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "packageName": "com.sovereignedge.pocketagent", "sig": "0210478b3ee16334d75ed5c7273bf544", "signer": "75b96d096a86ea8c58641a92531fcb5b4a6d2efc00b33051620969baad85450d", "size": 26256467, "targetSdkVersion": 36, "uses-permission": [["android.permission.INTERNET", null], 